'''Frostfire Dagger''' is a version of [[Nord Dagger]] upgraded with a [[Frostfire Essence]]. It loses a small amount of [[slash]] and [[Pierce|pierce damage]] in exchange for a larger amount of [[fire]] and [[Frost|frost damage]].

* The primary attack is a fast 3-slash combo with 2x damage on the last swing.
* Its secondary attack is a leaping stab with 3x damage.
* It deals 6x damage against [[Creature senses|unalerted]] enemies.

An upgraded Nord Dagger will '''NOT''' keep its upgrade level when it is crafted into Frostfire Dagger.

